        "eyebrow": "About Us",
        "heading": "Your health is <em>personal</em>. Now, so is your care.",
        "body": "<p>Most people who want to explore treatments for weight management, hormone health, or longevity run into the same problem: the traditional healthcare system is not designed for this kind of proactive, personalized care.</p><p>Long appointment waitlists, dismissive consultations, insurance gatekeeping, and fragmented care make it unnecessarily difficult to access treatments that are safe, available, and appropriate for many adults.</p><p>ChopinRX was built to close that gap — connecting consumers with independent licensed U.S. providers through a streamlined online process that puts the individual first.</p>"
